Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.25,0:00:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.25,0:00:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-ge-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.11,0:01:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your parasite-infected\Nmonster still can't attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.77,0:01:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.37,0:01:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.61,0:01:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that my ultimate\Ngreat moth has emerged,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you're as good as Squashed, and\Nyour two locator cards are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.25,0:01:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.53,0:01:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Zap that big bug, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.23,0:01:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.63,0:01:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be saying goodbye to\NBattle City in no time, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.25,0:01:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to witness the devastating\Npower of my Great Moth!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.93,0:01:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his alligator sword now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.63,0:01:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you must have some kind of giant\Nfly swatter or something in your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.27,0:01:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.89,0:01:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,His pom-pom girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.55,0:01:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me come over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.11,0:01:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.02,0:01:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to the parasites living\Noff his side of the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.67,0:01:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All of Wheeler's cards are now insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.27,0:01:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing my insect barrier to\Nblock every one of their attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.99,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,only Gate Guardian and the\NBlue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.55,0:02:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,have enough attack points\Nto defeat my Great Moth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.71,0:02:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I doubt you have neither\Nof them in your pathetic deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.11,0:02:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look too good for Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.11,0:02:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Great Moth is just too tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should just log offline now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.63,0:02:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.85,0:02:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's gonna win and we're\Nnot giving up on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.13,0:02:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.01,0:02:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,His life points keep getting lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.11,0:02:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey hasn't been able to attack,\Nand this monster seems unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.17,0:02:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the best move is to\Njust run away and hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.11,0:02:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean kind of like you did today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Some things are just really scary, especially\Nwhen you have to do them all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.69,0:02:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't want my x-ray taken,\Nso I'm gonna stay in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I ever gonna crush\NWeevil's great moth?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.53,0:02:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's too strong, and none\Nof my monsters can attack anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Deck, show me some love.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.37,0:02:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, just a card I needed, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.17,0:03:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out, you little vermin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.71,0:03:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.91,0:03:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down and switch\Nall my monster cards to attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.39,0:03:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I hear Joey right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.41,0:03:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How can Joey attack Weevil's moth\Nwhen his monsters are weaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The pressure's finally gotten to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.81,0:03:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's cracking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless he's doing what I think he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.13,0:03:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.39,0:03:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.71,0:03:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt that a fool like you could have\Nanything sneaky planned, but just in case,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place this monster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.41,0:03:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you remember Legol, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should refresh your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.85,0:03:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Legol!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bypass his monsters and attack\Nhis flight points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,since you put your parasite\Ncard in attack mode and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.27,0:03:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,it's technically your\Nweakest monster on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.95,0:04:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to attack it, which will\Nknock your life points down to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.21,0:04:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him off, my great morph!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.13,0:04:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Bug Brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.85,0:04:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal Skull Dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.15,0:04:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This card will reduce your monster's attack\Npower depending on the roll of the die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.37,0:04:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So the higher the number,\Nthe weaker your morph gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.89,0:04:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.69,0:04:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What? A two?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, it still cuts the attack\Npoints of your oversized pest in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.09,0:04:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a sad attempt\Nto survive, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.21,0:04:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My moth can still blow\Nyour parasite to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.09,0:04:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't count on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.51,0:04:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll reveal my other face-down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.69,0:04:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic card, Graceful Dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.17,0:04:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Part two of my ingenious\Nmaster plan. The higher I roll,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,the stronger my parasite\Nmonster will become,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you little Pyramid Bet you're sorry\Nyou snuck that into my deck now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:04:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:05:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a four or higher to swat you more
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Parasite's attack points\Nmultiply by 4 to 2,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Say bye-bye to your luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.03,0:05:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.93,0:05:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Up high!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew Joey could do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.25,0:05:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Great dueling!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.17,0:05:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.21,0:05:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, Joey just crushed\NWeevil's great moth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And he used the card Weevil\Nsnuck into his deck to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Weevil. Joey's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My moth, my precious, precious great moth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.91,0:05:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You've squashed it like a common fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.13,0:05:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel isn't over yet, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.27,0:05:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not by a mile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.83,0:05:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.47,0:05:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll exterminate all you little critters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:05:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You won that round.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.29,0:06:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But my next surprise will win me\Nthe duel and send you packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.31,0:06:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, we'll just see about that, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.75,0:06:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll play this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.19,0:06:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My insect soldiers of the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.71,0:06:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Next comes a magic card,\NEradicating Aerosol.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.31,0:06:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This card has the power to destroy\Nany insect card on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.15,0:06:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And since all of your parasite-infected\Nmonsters are still insects,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.39,0:06:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I could take one of them out,\Nbut I've got bigger plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.61,0:06:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So I play Pinch Hopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.57,0:06:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I can destroy my\Nown insect. What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.55,0:06:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Pinch Hopper goes to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil can summon any\Nmonster from his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.61,0:06:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Any monster? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.75,0:06:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Eradicating aerosols! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy my Pinch Hopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.17,0:06:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can summon a creature whose\Nattack power is virtually limitless
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Insect queen
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.15,0:07:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my rarest card and\Nif played the right way
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,is totally unstoppable\NPrepare to lose it all,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.69,0:07:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.19,0:07:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have defeated my great moth\NBut my queen will trounce your puny
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,defense and wipe out your life points\NNow you will face a power like no other
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.99,0:07:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to Battle City!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think my insect\Nqueen is powerful now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,just wait until you see\Nher special function.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She absorbs the attack points\Nof every insect on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still got less than your\Nmoth, and I creamed that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.39,0:07:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She absorbs the points of every insect,\Nyours included. Mine? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.39,0:07:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My monsters are still considered insects\Nbecause of that stinking parasite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.27,0:07:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now absorb their power, my queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.05,0:07:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a thousand more attack points!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Oh, no! Joey! Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,insect cards can be extremely tricky,\Nand to battle an insect duelist,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to think like an insect duelist!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.29,0:08:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You destroyed his great moth, and\Nyou can destroy his insect queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.19,0:08:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.83,0:08:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Joey's up against a monster that's\Neven stronger than the great moth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he face that thing all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.37,0:08:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.05,0:08:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey isn't alone, Kenta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows I'm always there with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.93,0:08:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I need help, I know my\Nbrother's always there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was scared to get my operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.99,0:08:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,he gave me the strength I\Nneeded to go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.73,0:08:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's more than my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.41,0:08:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's my friend, and we're there to\Nsupport each other no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So even though I'm not\Nnext to him right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,he knows I believe in him, and our bond\Nof friendship will always be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.59,0:08:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, will you be my friend? Sure. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you ever get frightened,\NI'll be there for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But right now, Joey\Nneeds both of our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's cheer him on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.53,0:09:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I give my queen\Nanother power boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice Legol.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.73,0:09:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The more she feeds, the\Nmore powerful she becomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.11,0:09:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Insect queen, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.83,0:09:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Annihilate this tiny guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.13,0:09:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your monster is Bug Juice, and\Nyou lost some serious life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And it gets better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.61,0:09:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,With every monster my queen\Ndestroys, she lays an egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,These eggs let her keep the extra attack\Npoints even after the monster's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.69,0:09:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, when these eggs hatch,\NI'll have an entire insect army.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.39,0:09:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta scramble those eggs before\Nany munchkin monsters hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be on me like\Na swarm of killer bees,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but as long as Weevil's insect\Nbarrier is in effect, I can't attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:10:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I do summon a monster, that\Nparasite card will turn it into a bug,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and then his insect queen will absorb\Nits attack points and get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be a way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.21,0:10:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.69,0:10:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face down\Non the field and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.61,0:10:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, you forgot to switch all your\Nmonsters back into defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.67,0:10:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's nothing defending your\Nlife points against my attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.05,0:10:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to finish you off, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.45,0:10:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.61,0:10:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If Joey's attacked now, his\Nlife points will drop to zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.97,0:10:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Cockroach\NKnight to feed my queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.71,0:10:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And whenever my cockroach is destroyed,\Nit returns to the top of my deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can keep sacrificing it\Nto increase my queen strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.83,0:10:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my Insect Queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,destroy his panther, then knock\Nhim out of the tournament for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.41,0:10:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Insect Queen, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.73,0:10:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life points are history!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.65,0:11:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure, Weaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.59,0:11:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you can guess\Nwhat's beneath card number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not a trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.57,0:11:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You kept your monsters in attack\Nmode on purpose, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,On the nosy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And because you fell for it and\Nwent for the kill, it's time to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.01,0:11:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate magic arm shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.15,0:11:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My insect soldiers of the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.61,0:11:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My magic arm shield lets me\Ndefend myself against your
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,attack by using one of your\Nmonsters to deflect the blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.27,0:11:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now who's point to history?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.01,0:11:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey just slipped through Weevil's\Ntraps for the second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you would, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.05,0:11:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have blocked one attack, but\Nyou're just prolonging your defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.31,0:11:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.23,0:12:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey'll shut him up as soon as\Nhe destroys that insect queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.77,0:12:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your fleece-sized brain\Nrun out of ideas already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,As my queen gets stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,she'll continue to lay eggs that'll\Nhatch into a swarm of insect warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.01,0:12:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And as if that wasn't enough to ensure\Nmy victory in this dual wheeler,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.73,0:12:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to my insect barrier,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.39,0:12:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you still can't attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.63,0:12:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't count your eggs yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,To protect my life points, I'll put\Nboth my monsters in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.15,0:12:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like someone's running\Nout of options, but relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise that I'll finish you quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.89,0:12:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You recognize this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.41,0:12:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cockroach night again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.51,0:12:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat and grow strong, my queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, attack his panther warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one bites the dust. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing standing in between Weevil\Nand my life points is that parasite cod.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:13:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta summon another monster\Nif I want to squash him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.99,0:13:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But whatever I summon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll become infected by the\Nparasite and feed his insect queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.59,0:13:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And once those eggs hatch,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.61,0:13:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in real trouble Time to hand over your\Ntwo locator cards and go home, Wheeler
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.81,0:13:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Bug Boy's right. I used\Nup my best cards already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.17,0:13:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and that queen's way too strong
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.29,0:13:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Joey. We're all behind you.\NTrust yourself, Joey. Trust your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.59,0:13:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus, Joey You've gotten out of tougher\Nsituations than this before And remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity looks to you for strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.55,0:13:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,so you've got to stomp this\Ntermite for your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.03,0:13:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.94,0:13:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity's never given up on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.37,0:13:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,When I dueled that\Npsychic fraud, Esperoba,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.75,0:13:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and the odds were against me, she\Nnever stopped believing in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.39,0:13:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm not about to let my sister down by
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.63,0:13:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,letting this bug-eyed\Nfreak get the best of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, the whole gang's rooting for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and with my friends behind\Nme, there's no way I can lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.05,0:13:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't quit on us now,\Nbecause we believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.47,0:14:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's in a tight spot, and he needs\Nall the strength we can give him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.85,0:14:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta keep cheering, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.41,0:14:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey! Joey! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.65,0:14:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.21,0:14:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let that little bug push you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.57,0:14:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe in yourself, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.21,0:14:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give up, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.41,0:14:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler doesn't quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.39,0:14:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'd understand if you had friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.23,0:14:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.29,0:14:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like things are\Nstarting to turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.71,0:14:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You are finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.81,0:14:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You know Parasite Parasite will\Ninfect any monster that you summon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face\Ndown, then summon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Gear Freed the Iron Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.49,0:14:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Once your knight has been\Ninfected by my Parasite card,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.49,0:14:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll just be another snack\Nfor my ravenous queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.01,0:15:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,don't be so sure about that weevil some\Ncards are bug proof what's wrong why can't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.65,0:15:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the parasite feed on it he's gear free\Nthe iron knight and that slimy parasite's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,helpless against his metal armor how'd you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.81,0:15:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,figure that out he did his homework weevil
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.51,0:15:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you should have known that parasite The\Nparasite wasn't able to feed off of metal,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.29,0:15:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and you call yourself an\Nexpert insect dualist? Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.55,0:15:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That means the knight can smash\Nthrough the insect barrier and attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.23,0:15:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And I got a perfect plan to wipe\Nout your insect queen, weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.53,0:15:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And my plan starts with those eggs. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.19,0:15:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba freed the iron knight, attack his\Nqueen's eggs, and lower her attack power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.17,0:15:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Next turn, you're bug food! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey remembered her weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The queen needs her eggs to\Nkeep her attack points high.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.05,0:16:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're destroyed, she gets weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the insect queen\Nchows an opponent's monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.51,0:16:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,she boosts her attack points\Nand she lays another egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.31,0:16:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But until they hatch,\Nthose eggs are defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.33,0:16:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that your insect barrier can't\Nstop my attacks, I'm free to wipe them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me, Weevil, does Insect Queen\Nlike our eggs poached a sunny side up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.45,0:16:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy this while it lasts,\Nbecause after my turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be one duel closer\Nto the Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.59,0:16:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No one gets away with\Ndisrespecting my queen like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.15,0:16:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to be pulverized as I power up my
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.69,0:16:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,mighty Insect Queen with\Neven more attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.47,0:16:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, I will summon Soldier Ant, then\Nactivate the Magic Card Ant Reproduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.65,0:16:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch them multiply into an ant colony!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:16:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:16:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This car takes one soldier\Nant and turns it into
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.17,0:17:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,an army of ten ants for\Nthe length of my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.81,0:17:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you know what's\Nnext! Right, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.81,0:17:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Queenie's gonna absorb the attack points\Nof each one and then get even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that my mighty\Nqueen's done powering up,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.57,0:17:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,it's the end of Joey\NWheeler once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.51,0:17:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.09,0:17:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.25,0:17:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If Weevil destroys Joey's\Nknight, this duel's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.41,0:17:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my lovely queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,destroy his scrap heap of a knight\Nand what's left of his life point!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.39,0:17:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.93,0:17:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you would\Nattack me. You were?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.15,0:17:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All part of my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate the trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Grave robber.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Not grave robber. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.09,0:18:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It can take a card from your\Ngraveyard and use it against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.39,0:18:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And he just nabbed you a can of aerosol.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to exterminate your queen
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.17,0:18:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there goes my best problem\NWhat have you done to my queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.79,0:18:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, I'm not true with\Nyou yet, Weevil Underpants
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.95,0:18:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Gearfield, destroy his last egg\Nand the rest of his life points
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Loserville, Weevil.\NPopulation, you. I... I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.91,0:18:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.79,0:18:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure showed that, little sneak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.97,0:18:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Weevil, cough them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.25,0:18:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your insect queen and two locator cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.15,0:18:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.91,0:18:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercy? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.65,0:18:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have thought of that\Nbefore you decided to cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.39,0:19:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, just like a duelist kingdom,\Nyou're out of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.77,0:19:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.67,0:19:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He won!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey kicked Weevil's buggy butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.89,0:19:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He almost lost a zillion\Ntimes, but he never gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.47,0:19:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, I'm through running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.67,0:19:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.69,0:19:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I can face anything, as long as\NI have friends like you. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.27,0:19:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe someday I can become a top-ranked\Nduelist just like your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.29,0:19:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then all my friends can\Ncome and cheer me on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.97,0:19:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cheer the loudest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.93,0:19:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So, can you get me Joey's autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.19,0:19:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Wheeler pulled it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.03,0:19:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't second at Duel's\NKingdom for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.51,0:19:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.42,0:19:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's almost made it to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And he did it all without his red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's my destiny to\Nhelp Yami save the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.27,0:19:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and I get the feeling Joey's\Nred eyes is gonna help me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.69,0:20:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy, especially with Merrick's\Nrare hunters out there looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.73,0:20:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.57,0:20:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The time is growing close, my mind slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.43,0:20:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon we'll destroy Yugi together!
